@startuml
!include _style.iuml
hide empty description
[*] --> Received : POST /api/predict
Received --> Unauthorized : missing / invalid token
Received --> Authenticated : token verified
Authenticated --> Rejected : schema validation fails
Authenticated --> Validated : 12 fields within range
Validated --> Scored : pipeline.predict_proba()
Scored --> Explained : TreeSHAP contributions
Explained --> Advised : build_suggestions()
Advised --> Persisted : INSERT health_data,\npredictions
Persisted --> Responded : 200 PredictionResult
Unauthorized --> [*] : 401
Rejected --> [*] : 422 field errors
Responded --> [*]
@enduml
